    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean yeah, i've talked to people. they all say the same thing. \"give it time,\" \"find a new hobby,\" \"you're still you.\" but i'm not. the version of me that mattered is dead. the version that could actually do things, achieve things... that person isn't coming back. it's like everyone is trying to fix a house that's already burned down to the ground.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
